            "image_asset": "revela-testimonial-reinet.jpg",
            "quote": "<p>I absolutely love my new pajama set! The Italian fabric is incredibly soft and luxurious, yet still practical since it is machine washable. The pattern is both unique and elegant, making it feel truly special. I am also so impressed with the craftsmanship. The stitching and finishing are excellent, clearly made with great care and attention to detail.</p>",
