            "details": "Customer review",
            "consent_text": "Shared with client approval."
          }
        },
        "review_carolyn": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "placeholder_label": "",
            "image_asset": "revela-testimonial-carolyn.jpg",
            "quote": "<p>I am obsessed with my newest purchase from Revela sleepwear. The combination of quality craftsmanship and superlative fibres makes for a high-end product. The lightness of the fabric creates a sense of freedom and relaxation. I feel like wearing it all day. Not to mention the stunning prints to choose from. This is the epitome of luxury to me.</p>",
            "name": "Carolyn",
            "details": "Customer review",
            "consent_text": "Shared with client approval."
          }
        },
        "review_petro": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "placeholder_label": "",
            "image_asset": "revela-testimonial-petro.jpg",
            "quote": "<p>Absolutely loved this handmade sleepwear! The colours are vibrant and the fit is perfect. It is clear that a lot of care and attention to detail went into making it. Definitely a unique and special gift worth giving or keeping for yourself!</p>",
            "name": "Petro",
            "details": "Customer review",
            "consent_text": "Shared with client approval."
          }
        },
        "review_sanet": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "placeholder_label": "",
            "image_asset": "revela-testimonial-sanet.jpg",
